# Keep the build context small and the image layers reproducible.
#
# NOTE: `.npmrc` and `package-lock.json` are deliberately NOT listed. The
# Dockerfile needs both — `.npmrc` pins the public registry so `npm ci` works
# without a CodeArtifact token, and `npm ci` requires the lockfile.

# Installed on the build host for the wrong architecture; `npm ci` reinstalls.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Always rebuilt inside the image; copying a stale dist in would mask a
# broken build.
**/dist
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage

# Secrets must never enter an image layer. Config is injected at run time.
.env
.env.*

# Local SQLite artifacts. The container's database lives in a named volume.
data
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

.git
.github
.DS_Store
*.log

# Prose. Not needed to build or run anything.
docs
think
.specBuilder
README.md
